936090316/","react_count":1,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-22T20:06:52.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-23T02:06:52.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"Schedule of Events (Corrections, additions welcome!)\nThursday, September 24, 2026 \nKick-Off Event: Our Town. Our Stories. celebration beginning the festivities.\n\nFriday, September 25, 2026\nFestival Hours: 3:00 PM – 12:00 AM (Activities & Vendors open)\nStreet Photography Session: 5:30 PM near the pavilion with Jennifer Maxfield (RSVP recommended)\nEvening Highlights: Live music, vendor booths, Outhouse Race preview/activities, Grand Valley Beard Rally, and the Friday Night Glow Party at Circle Park.\n\nSaturday, September 26, 2026Festival Hours: 8:30 AM – 10:00 PM\nFarmers & Makers Market: 8:30 AM – 12:00 PM (moved onto Aspen Avenue to merge with the festival)\nBaking & Canning Entries Due: 10:00 AM (Judging takes place following submission)\n\nFall Festival Parade: 10:00 AM along the main street downtown\n\nHistory Fair: 11:00 AM highlighting local heritage\n\nAll-Day & Featured Activities:\n10th Annual Outhouse Race\nPancake Breakfast\nPet Show & Tractor Show\nGrand Valley Beard Rally\nCupcake Eating Contest\nHorse-drawn carriage rides by Circle Park (offered by Absolute Prestige Ranch)\n\nSaturday Night Foam Party\nLive music performances throughout the day and evening.","creation_time":1790128841,"id":4475163746090735,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/3741333852807065/permalink/4475163746090735/","react_count":7,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-22T20:00:41.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-23T02:00:41.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"","creation_time":1790128637,"id":4475161549424288,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/3741333852807065/permalink/4475161549424288/","react_count":2,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-22T19:57:17.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-23T01:5